          {
            "title": "Updating a variable",
            "id": 126281,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>var</code> değişkenlerinin, <code>let</code> değişkenlerinin aksine, depoladıkları değerleri değiştirebildiğini ve güncelleyebildiğini zaten gördük.</p><p><code>=</code> işaretini kullanarak <code>status</code> içindeki değeri <code>\"Watching Netflix\"</code> yerine <code>\"Relaxing at the beach\"</code> olarak değiştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Watching Netflix&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Relaxing at the beach&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(currentStatus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Relaxing at the beach\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>=</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "As often as we want",
            "id": 126282,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>var</code> değişkenlerini istediğimiz kadar sık güncelleyebiliriz.</p><p>Kendin dene: <code>currentStatus</code> değerini <code>\"Reading\"</code> olarak değiştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Watching Netflix&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Relaxing at the Beach&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(currentStatus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Reading&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(currentStatus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"126\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Relaxing at the Beach\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Reading\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>currentStatus</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>\"Reading\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Setting with other variables",
            "id": 126283,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değişkeni diğerine eşitleyerek değişkenlere başka değişkenlerin değerlerini de verebiliriz.</p><p><code>currentStatus</code> değişkenine <code>defaultStatus</code> değerini ver.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" defaultStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi there!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing football&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"currentStatus = defaultStatus\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(currentStatus)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Playing football&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi there!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>defaultStatus</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Last value",
            "id": 126284,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değişkeni güncellediğimizde, önceki değerini unutur.</p><p><code>currentStatus</code> değişkeni <code>\"Playing football\"</code> ve <code>\"Walking the dog\"</code> olarak ayarlandığında görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing football&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(currentStatus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"currentStatus = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Walking the dog&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(currentStatus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var currentStatus\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Playing football\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Walking the dog\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>currentStatus</code>, ardından <code>currentStatus</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
