            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Başka değer türleri de var. Örneğin etrafında çift tırnak bulunmayan <strong>sayılar</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numberOfLikes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;5&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>5</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
