            "id": 126308,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sayılarla da ifadeler oluşturabiliriz. <code>+</code> işaretiyle sayıları birbirine ekler ve <code>-</code> işaretiyle birbirinden çıkarırız.</p><p><code>numberOfLikes</code>'ı <code>5 + 1</code> olarak ayarlayarak konsolda <code>6</code> değerini görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numberOfLikes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(numberOfLikes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>+</code>, ardından <code>1</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
