            "title": "Multiplication and division",
            "id": 126309,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sayıları çarpmak için <code>*</code> işaretini, bölmek içinse <code>/</code> işaretini kullanırız.</p><p><code>0.5</code> değerini <code>100</code> ile çarparak yüzde değerine dönüştür.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" percent = \" /><text value=\"0.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(percent)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"x\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"50.0\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>*</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
